{"Data":{"CardList":[{"Body":[{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[],"Description":[{"Len":4,"Position":2}],"BookName":[{"Len":4,"Position":0}]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":0,"AuthorId":1019021,"AuthorName":"天蚕土豆","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":1209977,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗破苍穹","BookType":1,"CategoryId":21,"CategoryName":"玄幻","CmId":0,"Description":"……斗破苍穹年番动画，每周日10:00正在腾讯视频火热播出，VIP抢先看2集；于深渊涅槃，收陨落心炎！斗破官方首套盲盒上","ExtValues":"41万人气","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":1681,"ShowTitle":"读小说","Sp":"{\"CBID\":\"22344671000280502\",\"card_pos\":\"0\",\"cardtype\":\"27\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"0\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"0\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\",\"title\":\"斗破苍穹\"}","Staticscore":417313,"SubCategoryId":73,"SubCategoryName":"异世大陆","TagType":0,"Views":0,"WordsCount":5332322},"ItemType":0},{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":[],"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":11056455603600501,"AuthorId":0,"AuthorName":"暮玖Ayla","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":4,"BookId":0,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗破苍穹","BookType":3,"CategoryId":80001,"CategoryName":"玄幻","CmId":0,"Description":"萧炎，主人公，萧家历史上空前绝后的斗气修炼天才。4岁就开始修炼斗之气，10岁拥有了九段斗之气，11岁突破十段斗之气，一跃成为家族百年来最年轻的斗者。然而在12岁那年，他却“丧失”了修炼能力，只拥有三段斗之气。整整三年时间，家族冷落，旁人轻视，被未婚妻退婚……种种打击接踵而至。就在他即将绝望的时候，一缕灵魂从他手上的戒指里浮现，一扇全新的大门在面前开启！萧炎重新成为家族年轻一辈中的佼佼者，受到众人的仰慕，他却不满足于此。为了一雪退婚带来的耻辱，萧炎来到了魔兽山脉，在药老的帮助下，进一步提升自己的修为……在魔兽山脉，他结识了小医仙，云芝（云岚宗宗主云韵）。他面向的世界更加宽广了。三十年河东，三十年河西，莫欺少年穷！年仅15岁的萧家废物，于此地，立下了誓言，从今以后便一步步走向斗气大陆巅峰！总算是结束了，末了留了一个另外的悬念，萧炎的血是热的，安静的生活，并不适合他的骨子，留下的悬念，就当为了让他有着征战的理由。作者：@天蚕土豆演播：旁白：@暮玖Ayla   报幕：@紫襟众CV：@CV阑珊梦   @何其   @斜杠    @地狱冥想的自嘲    @瓦塔 @谷仓@沁色  @有声忧蓝@有声心冢@红绡@谷映蝶@琅琊萌主@青山@栗子@伽蛮 等，CV持续更新","ExtValues":"1191集","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":1191,"ShowTitle":"听真人讲书","Sp":"{\"ADID\":\"11056455603600501\",\"audioname\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"card_pos\":\"0\",\"cardtype\":\"27\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"1\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"1\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\"}","Staticscore":408978,"SubCategoryId":0,"SubCategoryName":"","TagType":0,"Views":5851846,"WordsCount":0},"ItemType":0},{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[],"BookName":[{"Len":4,"Position":0}]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"连载","AdId":0,"AuthorId":0,"AuthorName":"知音漫客","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":0,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗破苍穹","BookType":2,"CategoryId":50001,"CategoryName":"漫画","CmId":7782521204336702,"Description":"正所谓三十年河东三十年河西，天才少年因忽然失去了天生的灵力，被所有人嘲笑排挤，为了一雪前耻他亲手毁掉婚约，一心进修、打怪、升级！重登人生巅峰的他让人们知道莫欺少年穷真的很重要！【授权】","ExtValues":"672话","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":672,"ShowTitle":"看漫画","Sp":"{\"CMID\":\"7782521204336702\",\"card_pos\":\"0\",\"cardtype\":\"27\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"2\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"2\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\",\"title\":\"斗破苍穹\"}","Staticscore":0,"SubCategoryId":0,"SubCategoryName":"热血","TagType":0,"Views":0,"WordsCount":0},"ItemType":0}],"CardType":4,"Sp":"","UiType":1004},{"Body":[{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":0,"AuthorId":432693234,"AuthorName":"杰山人","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":1037775359,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗罗杀星，从武魂殿砍到神界中枢","BookType":1,"CategoryId":12,"CategoryName":"轻小说","CmId":0,"Description":"【无女主】【杀伐无双】一朝梦醒，叶修穿越斗罗大陆。成为武魂殿的一个猎杀小队的队长。觉醒【无尽进化系统】只需要无限猎杀便可无限提升自己实力与武魂品质虽为魂斗罗实力，身份却比肩众多长老。自武魂殿中长大，想着武魂殿最后的悲惨落幕。想着所谓的武魂殿三美的糊涂之事。叶修疯狂杀伐以进化武魂，只为能力挽狂澜。那一日，教皇殿内，比比东开启了猎杀小舞计划。叶修的血色长枪，对准了胡列娜……武魂血枪所过之处，皆为武魂殿所属。当血色长枪穿破云霄之日，当血枪阴影横亘在神界中枢之上时。叶修漠然的注视一切反对之人：“血枪之下，无教皇、少主、圣女之分！”","ExtValues":"0人气","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":291,"ShowTitle":"读小说","Sp":"{\"CBID\":\"27189760304704904\",\"card_pos\":\"1\",\"cardid\":\"51012008\",\"cardtype\":\"3\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"0\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"name\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"3\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\",\"title\":\"斗罗杀星，从武魂殿砍到神界中枢\"}","Staticscore":0,"SubCategoryId":281,"SubCategoryName":"衍生同人","TagId":51012008,"TagType":0,"Views":0,"WordsCount":620369},"ItemType":0},{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":31196892903658701,"AuthorId":4378281,"AuthorName":"醉吞山河","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":1027376875,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"诸天之我不是道祖","BookType":1,"CategoryId":9,"CategoryName":"科幻","CmId":0,"Description":"虽然，这个世界叫洪荒。虽然，大陆中央有一座名为不周的山。虽然，我才抓了一个自以为是罗睺的穿越者。但，这个世界真不是洪荒，我也真的不是鸿钧道祖。高要:“别说了，我明白，道祖在上，受弟子一拜。”洪易:“多谢道祖传我人人如龙之法。”萧炎:“道祖太低调了，除了你，又有谁能批发造化玉碟？”洪军低头看了看自己手中的东西，现在说这玩意儿是光碟，还来得及吗？","ExtValues":"0人气","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":394,"ShowTitle":"读小说","Sp":"{\"CBID\":\"19801408308088304\",\"card_pos\":\"1\",\"cardid\":\"51012008\",\"cardtype\":\"3\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"1\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"name\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"4\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\",\"title\":\"诸天之我不是道祖\"}","Staticscore":0,"SubCategoryId":251,"SubCategoryName":"时空穿梭","TagId":51012008,"TagType":0,"Views":0,"WordsCount":857713},"ItemType":0},{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":0,"AuthorId":431313593,"AuthorName":"小妖盖","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":1039863243,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗罗：萧炎穿越成霍雨浩","BookType":1,"CategoryId":12,"CategoryName":"轻小说","CmId":0,"Description":"手握日月摘星辰，世间无我这般人！都说霍雨浩最后忘记了初心，被唐三巡成了狗，那如果萧炎带着拥有药老灵魂体的戒指，穿越到斗罗大陆成为了霍雨浩呢？假如蝴蝶煽动了翅膀，命运脱离了原有的轨道…【已有8000均订150万字完本精品斗一同人《斗罗：萧炎穿越成唐三兄弟》请大家放心追读】","ExtValues":"0人气","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":188,"ShowTitle":"读小说","Sp":"{\"CBID\":\"29295940807177304\",\"card_pos\":\"1\",\"cardid\":\"51012008\",\"cardtype\":\"3\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"2\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"name\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\",\"pos\":\"5\",\"scene\":\"qidian_multi_text_search\",\"timestamp\":\"1786666690430\",\"title\":\"斗罗：萧炎穿越成霍雨浩\"}","Staticscore":0,"SubCategoryId":281,"SubCategoryName":"衍生同人","TagId":51012008,"TagType":0,"Views":0,"WordsCount":751208},"ItemType":0},{"Highlight":["斗破苍穹"],"HighlightMap":{"SubCategoryName":[],"BookName":[{"Len":2,"Position":0}]},"ItemData":{"ActionStatus":0,"ActionStatusString":"完本","AdId":0,"AuthorId":432713684,"AuthorName":"暴走的男神","BookCover":"","BookCoverTag":0,"BookId":1039548442,"BookLevel":0,"BookName":"斗破：娶妻薰儿，她却拒绝圆房！","BookType":1,"CategoryId":12,"CategoryName":"轻小说","CmId":0,"Description":"古飞穿越斗气大陆。成为了古族八星斗圣强者，黑湮王古烈的亲孙子！十六岁时，古飞便已经成为古族最为出色的天才！在这之后，族长古元将薰儿召回，并且许配给古飞！不过，成婚之后，半年时间，薰儿都不肯与古飞圆房！古飞之前虽然很痴迷于薰儿，但是，当他发现，薰儿对他的冷漠，是因为牵挂其他男人。他的心彻底死了！原来，薰儿说的没准备好，是打算将贞洁留给别的男人！这让古飞如何能忍？他果断选择与薰儿离婚！“不，古飞，你要相信我，我绝对没有背叛过你！”得知古飞要与自己离婚，薰儿顿时慌了。","ExtValues":"0人气","InterestType":0,"IsPublication":0,"IsSign":0,"IsTop":0,"Rate":0,"RoleId":0,"SectionCount":351,"ShowTitle":"读小说","Sp":"{\"CBID\":\"29081481103702504\",\"card_pos\":\"1\",\"cardid\":\"51012008\",\"cardtype\":\"3\",\"expid\":\"qidian_text_search_model\",\"item_pos\":\"3\",\"keywords\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"logid\":\"351888245298027004\",\"name\":\"斗破苍穹\",\"need_rewrite\":\"1\"